# This repository is a Unity package, not a Unity project — there is no Library/, Temp/ or Logs/
# to ignore. Almost everything here is source, and every asset's .meta file must be committed
# alongside it or GUID references break for whoever pulls next.

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# JetBrains / Visual Studio / VS Code
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user

# Unity leaves these behind when a package folder is opened directly
*.tmp
*.pidb
*.booproj
